      "id": "claim_3ba038d6618e4ecc83b72867613e6242",
      "statement": "The celld workspace splits ownership by design: crates/logic owns all behavioral state and decisions, and crates/celld is only an effect executor and adapter host.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Cargo.toml#L1-L5",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:462368a26313f48ed93009e7cd4f07d3415bc44514868055ae8b0535a168acc8:"
        }
